      "n_chars": 836,
      "section": "Discrimination at one year and across horizons",
      "first_line_excerpt": "In the one-year design, the fused model had the highest AUROC of the methods compared, 0.7776 (95\\% CI [0.7664"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0065",
      "sha256": "20ca9db52d3e3a6a5d8751e60974a4fb50d2b579305585d42a67ea7642ba45c7",
