      "char_start": 36226,
      "char_end": 37061,
      "n_chars": 835,
      "section": "Discrimination at one year and across horizons",
      "first_line_excerpt": "One survival model gave the fused model an AUROC of 0.723 [0.701, 0.745] at 120 days, for onset in the 90 days"
    },
